# Dump the exported crystal as VRML, for eyeballing the geometry GEANT4 built.
#
#   ceelo_g4val detector_26.gdml macros/vis_crystal_vrml.mac out.csv --vis-batch
#
# Writes g4_NN.wrl in the working directory.  The mesh in that file is G4's own
# polyhedron for each solid -- i.e. what GEANT4 made of the GDML, not what the
# GDML says -- so it is a genuine check of the export.  Render it with
# tools/geant4_validation/render_vrml.py, or open it in any VRML viewer.
#
# Note: do NOT use the RayTracer driver here; see the comment on the run
# manager in src/main.cc for why it cannot work from this executable.

/vis/open VRML2FILE
/vis/viewer/set/culling global false
/vis/drawVolume
/vis/viewer/flush
